    "physical_description": null,
    "summary": "Mask, with mammalian or human features surmounted by shredded bark and a flat round disc, painted with a face, the whole representing the moon. Carved of red cedar wood the mask has exagerated chin, nose and eyebrows/forehead, and is painted white, the red cedar showing through, with black formlines round the mouth, black eyebrows and orbits, green nose and eyesockets, red chin, mouth, nostrils and formlines to the sides of the eyes. The face on the disc is of similar configuration, and is attached to a pole or stick inserted in the top of the mask. It is signed on the inside &#039;Tony Hunt jnr /83&#039;.",
